Package: convertor-tool
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: default-jre (>= 21) | default-jre-headless (>= 21) | java-runtime (>= 21)
Maintainer: Convertor Tool Team
Description: Bi-directional document converter
 Converts between DOCX, PDF, and Markdown formats.
 Supports: DOCX→MD, PDF→MD, MD→DOCX, MD→PDF.
 Includes both GUI and CLI interfaces.
